si.add_heading('Important limits and sources',level=1)
si.add_paragraph('Neither eight- nor ten-megawatt hourly power output is independently manufacturer-certified. The 10 MW 11.0 m/s rated-speed assumption changes results materially. The five GWA locations are summit or project-area sample pixels, not layouts; transmission, roads, cranes, icing, turbulence, environmental constraints and interconnection are excluded. The 35%-cap and 10%-mean-speed reduction both require emergency fossil gas in the selected designs. Rotor-spacing envelope is a geometric screen, not permissible land area or an actual engineering layout.')
si.add_paragraph('Data sources: GWA 100-m Canadian country raster sampled to five points (https://globalwindatlas.info/); ERA5 weather for 2010–2025 (Copernicus); Statistics Canada table 25-10-0015-01 for BC monthly wind output; Alberta AESO metered generation for out-of-region ramp comparisons; SANY manufacturer product pages [61,62]. Derived code outputs are inside the submission archive. Data licenses and permanent DOI require independent review before posting.')
si.save(SUB/'Joule_Supplemental_Information.docx')
