cover=Document();cover.add_paragraph('6 November 2026');cover.add_paragraph('Editors, Joule');cover.add_paragraph('Dear Editors,')
cover.add_paragraph('I submit “Digital Gardens versus Wonder Valley: Comparing renewable AI networks and gas-powered campuses” for consideration as a Research Article in Joule.')
cover.add_paragraph(f'The paper compares a proposed 17-node British Columbia computing network with a generic Wonder Valley-type Alberta gas-campus counterfactual at equal 3.75 GW IT load. It evaluates independent site allocations for an 8 MW SANY onshore turbine model and a 10 MW option, 16 years of hourly ERA5/GWA-informed resources, battery/renewable-fuel dispatch and 25-year technoeconomics. The main 8 MW scenario costs C${sw["lcoe_25y_cad_mwh"]:.1f}/MWh versus modeled gas cases of C$75–114/MWh, and emits {e:.2f} versus {ng:.2f} Mt CO₂e/year in the selected conditional cases.')
cover.add_paragraph(f'We report the limitations prominently. The selected 8 MW layout meets the no-gas constraint under 40%-capped GWA/ERA5 means, but requires up to {a["stress"]["cap35_same_installation"]["gas_gwh_max"]:.0f} GWh emergency gas in a 35%-cap stress and {a["stress"]["GWA90pct_cap40"]["gas_gwh_max"]:.0f} GWh under 10% lower GWA mean speeds. The 10 MW manufacturer has not supplied the rated-speed curve used in the model. Neither option is independently validated for site resource, transport, grid connection, fuel contracts or community heat offtake. We preserve Wonder Valley by name while explicitly separating its public development plans from our hypothetical equal-load gas model.')
cover.add_paragraph('The enclosed manuscript, supplemental figures and tables, executable code and source-provenance records are supplied for review. A public repository DOI is not yet registered; licensing must be checked before redistributing third-party raw data. The author conceived the Digital Gardens proposal and discloses his potential interest. AI-assisted work is disclosed only as Artificial Inventor/Synthetic Scientist V63.')
cover.add_paragraph('Sincerely,');cover.add_paragraph('Jonathan Karl Bily');cover.add_paragraph('Independent Researcher, Zaragoza, Spain');cover.add_paragraph('jonathan@cloudwashlaundry.com');cover.save(SUB/'Joule_Cover_Letter.docx')
